tests/fixtures/doctype-corpus/runs/

# real-corpus: NOTE THE PDFs ARE NOT IGNORED HERE, unlike the two corpora
# above. Those hold BUILD OUTPUT rebuilt from html/ by bin/render-*-corpus; a
# real supplier PDF has no source to rebuild from, so the PDF IS the source and
# is tracked. Only the bundles, the carved-out page ranges and saved runs are
# generated. Rebuild/re-measure with bin/eval-aj-docs.
tests/fixtures/real-corpus/.build/
tests/fixtures/real-corpus/runs/
